.SH NAME
git-bug-bug-status-ready - Mark a draft pull-request as ready for review


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-bug bug status ready [BUG_ID] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Transition a pull-request from draft to open. No-op for non-draft PRs and rejected for issues.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for ready


